ta&nbsp;hai.&nbsp;Dhoop&nbsp;ki&nbsp;khushbu&nbsp;hawa&nbsp;mein&nbsp;ghulti&nbsp;hai.</p><p>Aur&nbsp;uss&nbsp;pal&nbsp;mein&nbsp;—&nbsp;tumhara&nbsp;phone,&nbsp;tumhari&nbsp;tension,&nbsp;tumhara&nbsp;to-do&nbsp;list&nbsp;—&nbsp;sab&nbsp;kuch&nbsp;gayab&nbsp;ho&nbsp;jaata&nbsp;hai.</p><p>Yeh&nbsp;Ganga&nbsp;Aarti&nbsp;hai,&nbsp;Varanasi&nbsp;ki.</p><h3>Ganga&nbsp;Aarti&nbsp;Varanasi&nbsp;Timings&nbsp;2026</h3><p><strong>Season</strong></p><p><strong>Aarti&nbsp;Time</strong></p><p>Summer&nbsp;(Mar–Jun)</p><p>7:00&nbsp;PM</p><p>Monsoon&nbsp;(Jul–Sep)</p><p>7:00&nbsp;PM</p><p>Winter&nbsp;(Oct–Feb)</p><p>6:00&nbsp;PM</p><p>⚠️&nbsp;<strong>Pro&nbsp;Tip:</strong>&nbsp;Reach&nbsp;45&nbsp;minutes&nbsp;early&nbsp;agar&nbsp;tum&nbsp;front&nbsp;row&nbsp;mein&nbsp;baithna&nbsp;chahte&nbsp;ho.&nbsp;Late&nbsp;aaye&nbsp;toh&nbsp;crowd&nbsp;mein&nbsp;khade&nbsp;rehna&nbsp;padega.</p><h3>Kahan&nbsp;Hoti&nbsp;Hai&nbsp;Ganga&nbsp;Aarti&nbsp;Varanasi&nbsp;Mein?</h3><p>Varanasi&nbsp;mein&nbsp;3&nbsp;jagah&nbsp;Ganga&nbsp;Aarti&nbsp;hoti&nbsp;hai&nbsp;—&nbsp;but&nbsp;sab&nbsp;equal&nbsp;nahi&nbsp;hain.</p><p><strong>1.&nbsp;Dashashwamedh&nbsp;Ghat&nbsp;⭐&nbsp;Sabse&nbsp;Bada</strong></p><ul><li>Yeh&nbsp;main&nbsp;Ganga&nbsp;Aarti&nbsp;hai&nbsp;Varanasi&nbsp;ki.</li><li>5&nbsp;purohit&nbsp;ek&nbsp;saath&nbsp;perform&nbsp;karte&nbsp;hain.</li><li>Crowd&nbsp;sabse&nbsp;zyada&nbsp;—&nbsp;but&nbsp;experience&nbsp;bhi&nbsp;sabse&nbsp;powerful.</li></ul><p><strong>2.&nbsp;Assi&nbsp;Ghat</strong></p><ul><li>Thodi&nbsp;choti&nbsp;aur&nbsp;intimate&nbsp;aarti.</li><li>Sunset&nbsp;ke&nbsp;baad&nbsp;hoti&nbsp;hai.</li><li>Foreign&nbsp;tourists&nbsp;zyada&nbsp;prefer&nbsp;karte&nbsp;hain&nbsp;yahan.</li></ul><p><strong>3.&nbsp;Rajendra&nbsp;Prasad&nbsp;Ghat</strong></p><ul><li>Relatively&nbsp;quieter&nbsp;experience.</li><li>Families&nbsp;ke&nbsp;liye&nbsp;perfect.</li></ul><h3>Boat&nbsp;Se&nbsp;Ganga&nbsp;Aarti&nbsp;Dekhna&nbsp;—&nbsp;Ek&nbsp;Alag&nbsp;Hi&nbsp;Duniya&nbsp;Hai</h3><p>Kuch&nbsp;log&nbsp;ghat&nbsp;pe&nbsp;baithte&nbsp;hain.&nbsp;Kuch&nbsp;log&nbsp;naav&nbsp;pe&nbsp;baithe&nbsp;dekhte&nbsp;hain.</p><p>Naav&nbsp;pe&nbsp;baithke&nbsp;Ganga&nbsp;Aarti&nbsp;dekhna&nbsp;—&nbsp;yeh&nbsp;ek&nbsp;completely&nbsp;different&nbsp;experience&nbsp;hai.</p><ul><li>Ghat&nbsp;ka&nbsp;panoramic&nbsp;view&nbsp;milta&nbsp;hai.</li><li>Bheed&nbsp;se&nbsp;door,&nbsp;shanti&nbsp;mein.</li><li>Aarti&nbsp;ki&nbsp;reflection&nbsp;Ganga&nbsp;ke&nbsp;paani&nbsp;mein&nbsp;—&nbsp;woh&nbsp;drishya&nbsp;photograph&nbsp;nahi,&nbsp;sirf&nbsp;aankhon&nbsp;mein&nbsp;kaid&nbsp;hota&nbsp;hai.</li><li>Diyas&nbsp;(earthen&nbsp;lamps)&nbsp;paani&nbsp;mein&nbsp;chhodna&nbsp;—&nbsp;woh&nbsp;moment&nbsp;tum&nbsp;kabhi&nbsp;nahi&nbsp;bhuloge.</li></ul><p><a href="https://soilnsoultravels.com/services/city-tour" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">SoilnSoul&nbsp;ke&nbsp;saath&nbsp;Ganga&nbsp;Aarti&nbsp;boat&nbsp;experience&nbsp;book&nbsp;karo</a>&nbsp;—&nbsp;guided,&nbsp;safe,&nbsp;aur&nbsp;sabse&nbsp;acha&nbsp;view&nbsp;guarantee&nbsp;ke&nbsp;saath.</p><blockquote><strong>Planning&nbsp;your&nbsp;complete&nbsp;Kashi&nbsp;itinerary?</strong>&nbsp;Make&nbsp;sure&nbsp;you&nbsp;check&nbsp;out&nbsp;our&nbsp;latest&nbsp;guide&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.soilnsoultravels.com/blog/5-reasons-we-are-the-best-tours-and-travel-agency-in-varanasi" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">5&nbsp;Reasons&nbsp;We&nbsp;Are&nbsp;the&nbsp;BEST&nbsp;Tours&nbsp;and&nbsp;Travel&nbsp;Agency&nbsp;in&nbsp;Varanasi</a></strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;see&nbsp;why&nbsp;travelers&nbsp;trust&nbsp;us&nbsp;with&nbsp;their&nbsp;spiritual&nbsp;journeys!</blockquote><h3>Ganga&nbsp;Aarti&nbsp;Ke&nbsp;Baad&nbsp;Kya&nbsp;Karo?</h3><p>Aarti&nbsp;khatam&nbsp;nahi&nbsp;hoti&nbsp;—&nbsp;sirf&nbsp;shuru&nbsp;hoti&nbsp;hai&nbsp;tumhari&nbsp;Varanasi&nbsp;ki&nbsp;asli&nbsp;raat.</p><p>✅&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://soilnsoultravels.com/blog/best-tours-and-travels-agency-in-varanasi-a-complete-local-guide-for-smar